# The Clue (otherAreas 5): its reply kinds against Event-priority competitors set by a GM: Rycharde the Chef accepted
# (Rycharde 72, Take 68; RQ1 sorts before RQ6) and The Basics completed with Quest[4][6]CommentaryValgeir 1 (Valgeir 107,
# Event; RQ7 sorts after; its Rycharde 98 and Take 67 are replaceDefault and lose to any Event). On a tie the lookup's
# action cycle plays the actions in container order, one per talk, from where it last stopped. Available: Rycharde's 90
# and 91 (Progress: an Event one would tie and the cycle would play 72 first); not due: The Clue's nil, 72 alone; Take's
# 64 (Event): 68, then 64; Valgeir's 143 (Event): 143, then 107 (whose finish clears the var: a GM sets it again).
# Accepted: Rycharde's 85 (Event): 72, then 85; Take's 65 (Event): 68, then 65; Valgeir's 143: 143, then 107. The trade
# replies (92 Progress, 93 Event) have no competitor.
lists Mhaura/Rycharde/onTrigger Mhaura/Take/onTrigger Selbina/Valgeir/onTrigger Mhaura/onEventFinish/90 Mhaura/onEventFinish/91 Selbina/onEventFinish/107
char zone=Mhaura pos=18.9,-16,88.8 job=WAR lvl=30
quest OtherAreas.Expertise completed
quest OtherAreas.RychardeTheChef accepted
quest OtherAreas.TheBasics completed
charvar Quest[4][4]DayCompleted 7992
charvar Quest[4][6]CommentaryValgeir 1
fame Windurst 325
login
trigger Rycharde                        # Prog 0: 90 (Progress beats 72)
finish option=0                         # Prog 1, Quest[4][4]DayCompleted 0
trigger Rycharde                        # Prog 1: 91 (Progress beats 72)
finish option=0
charvar Quest[4][4]DayCompleted 7993    # a GM: not due
trigger Rycharde                        # The Clue's nil: 72 alone
finish
trigger Take                            # 68 (a tie with 64: the first container's)
finish
trigger Take                            # 64
finish
warp 59,-15.27,20.2 Selbina
trigger Valgeir                         # 143 (a tie with The Basics' 107: The Clue's first)
finish
trigger Valgeir                         # 107
finish                                  # CommentaryValgeir 0
charvar Quest[4][6]CommentaryValgeir 1  # a GM
warp 19,-16,88.8 Mhaura
charvar Quest[4][4]DayCompleted 7992
trigger Rycharde                        # Prog 1: 91
finish option=83                        # begun
trigger Rycharde                        # accepted: 72 (a tie with 85)
finish
trigger Rycharde                        # 85
finish
trigger Take                            # 68 (a tie with 65; the warp cleared the cycle: it starts over)
finish
trigger Take                            # 65
finish
warp 59,-15.27,20.2 Selbina
trigger Valgeir                         # 143 (a tie with 107; the warp cleared the cycle: it starts over)
finish
trigger Valgeir                         # 107
finish
